1772105866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free the citizens from their digital trance and bring color back into their grey lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons here\u2026<br>Just a watering can, an umbrella...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102250/extras/cd3173560cf188f60df9ce1034ca593c.poster.avif?t=1772105866\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102250/extras/cd3173560cf188f60df9ce1034ca593c.webm?t=1772105866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102250/extras/cd3173560cf188f60df9ce1034ca593c.mp4?t=1772105866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 and above all: a boombox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102250/extras/ee04613632a267f965a1fbab6e076b5a.poster.avif?t=1772105866\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102250/extras/ee04613632a267f965a1fbab6e076b5a.webm?t=1772105866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102250/extras/ee04613632a267f965a1fbab6e076b5a.mp4?t=1772105866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record and tweak sounds, then broadcast them to interact with the world.<br>Each frequency generates a different glowing orb: some wake up the citizens, others alter the environment\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just have to find the right frequency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D platformer inspired by 80s/90s classics, entirely hand-drawn.<br>A mix of action, exploration, and (optional) interactive dialogues, carried by offbeat, satirical humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KOVOCLAK</strong> offers a playfully biting look at our hyperconnected, productivity-obsessed society\u2014while calling on your creativity to break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to free the city... by making some noise!</strong></p>","developers":["lingouf"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3102250/0f6fdd9054db0703ec698f8a1b83a2700a46795f/header.jpg?t=1772105866","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> ubuntu 22.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3102250/1510582420/4c783b87ec01ad74022518295af1c51bca1c1dc2/1750974919/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750695889","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3102250/1510582420/4c783b87ec01ad74022518295af1c51bca1c1dc2/1750974919/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750695889","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3102250/1510582420/4c783b87ec01ad74022518295af1c51bca1c1dc2/1750974919/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750695889","id":257148522,"name":" KOVOCLAK \u2013 Surreal Indie Game (Official Trailer \u2013 2025 Gameplay) ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148522/8803f41e20731f4cc843bf5af74624b90a16fee7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750695889"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3102250/1243562947/6d4b09e20b16ccc3e54a8f40a24fa710f4d4d15c/1